cle-title><source>International Social Science Journal</source><volume>57</volume><fpage>609</fpage><lpage>620</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>Supervision visits were supported by the World Health Organization. Data collection for the study was supported by an anonymous donor.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>